order: 1
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and year = 2027 and month = 6 and sikorski_nightmare = 1 and sikorski_repeal_stage = 4
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.sikorski_labor_stage_before_repeal > 0) {
    if (Q.left_president) {
        Q.sikorski_labor_vetoed = 1;
        Q.sikorski_left_veto_count += 1;
        Q.sikorski_veto_president_branded = 1;
        Q.left_poll = Math.max(0, (Number(Q.left_poll) || 0) - 0.25);
        Q.left_poll_momentum -= 0.30;
        Q.public_trust -= 2;
    } else {
        Q.labor_reform_stage = 0;
        Q.labor_reform_progress = 0;
        Q.pip_law_enacted = 0;
    }
}
if (Q.sikorski_marriage_vetoed && Q.marriage_reform_stage > 0) {
    Q.sikorski_marriage_override_votes =
        Math.round(
            Math.max(0, Number(Q.pis_seats) || 0) *
            (Q.left_president ? 0.25 : 1)
        ) +
        Math.max(0, Number(Q.konf_seats) || 0) +
        Math.max(0, Number(Q.psl_seats) || 0) +
        Math.round(Math.max(0, Number(Q.ko_seats) || 0) * 0.35) +
        Math.round(Math.max(0, Number(Q.p2050_seats) || 0) * 0.25);
    if (Q.left_president) {
        Q.sikorski_marriage_override_votes = Math.min(
            275,
            Q.sikorski_marriage_override_votes
        );
    }
    if (Q.sikorski_marriage_override_votes >= 276) {
        Q.marriage_reform_stage = 0;
        Q.marriage_reform_progress = 0;
        Q.partnership_sejm_passed = 0;
        Q.partnership_implementation_complete = 0;
        Q.partnership_revision_enacted = 0;
    } else {
        Q.marriage_reform_progress = Math.max(
            0,
            Q.marriage_reform_progress - 25
        );
    }
}
Q.sikorski_reforms_repealed =
    (Q.sikorski_abortion_stage_before_repeal > 0 &&
        Q.abortion_reform_stage <= 0 ? 1 : 0) +
    (Q.sikorski_marriage_stage_before_repeal > 0 &&
        Q.marriage_reform_stage <= 0 ? 1 : 0) +
    (Q.sikorski_labor_stage_before_repeal > 0 &&
        Q.labor_reform_stage <= 0 ? 1 : 0);
Q.sikorski_repeal_stage = 5;
Q.sikorski_police_militarisation += 3;
Q.sikorski_protest_strength += 10;
Q.labor_credibility -= Q.sikorski_labor_stage_before_repeal > 0 ? 8 : 0;
Q.workers_support -= Q.sikorski_labor_stage_before_repeal > 0 ? 5 : 0;
if (Q.sikorski_labor_stage_before_repeal > 0) {
    Q.labor_dissent += 12;
    Q.labor_mobilization += 8;
    if (Q.sikorski_labor_vetoed) {
        Q.union_trust += 5;
        Q.opzz_cooperation += 5;
    } else {
        Q.union_trust -= 3;
        Q.opzz_cooperation -= 2;
    }
}
Q.public_trust -= 6;
Q.far_right_agenda += 12;
Q.ending_score -= 8 * Q.sikorski_reforms_repealed +
    3 * Math.max(
        0,
        Q.sikorski_reforms_at_risk - Q.sikorski_reforms_repealed
    );
Q.last_policy_stage = Q.sikorski_left_veto_count > 0
    ? "Preserved by presidential vetoes; implementation under attack"
    : "Dismantled across the Sikorski repeal calendar";
Q.last_policy_authority = Q.sikorski_left_veto_count > 0
    ? "Presidential vetoes preserving statutes against replacement-cabinet repeal votes"
    : "Replacement-cabinet administration, Sejm repeal votes and any completed presidential override";
Q.last_policy_implementation = 0;
Q.news_headline = Q.sikorski_labor_vetoed
    ? "The veto President stops the labour repeal and loses more polling ground"
    : "The labour repeal passes behind a militarised government perimeter";
!}

= June 2027 — The nightmare becomes an institution

[? if not sikorski_labor_vetoed: The labour package is dismantled last.
Inspectors lose reclassification powers, enforcement appointments remain
frozen and the employment-code settlement is repealed.?][? if
sikorski_labor_vetoed: **President [+ president_name +]** vetoes the labour
repeal. Reclassification powers and the employment-code settlement remain in
law, although the cabinet continues freezing appointments and enforcement.?]
Unions join the equality and reproductive-rights protests that have continued
since winter.

[? if sikorski_marriage_vetoed and marriage_reform_stage > 0: Sikorski finds
only **[+ sikorski_marriage_override_votes +] override votes**. **President [+
president_name +]'s** veto holds, so marriage equality survives in law while hostile ministries
hollow out its implementation.?][? if sikorski_marriage_vetoed and
marriage_reform_stage = 0: Sikorski assembles **[+
sikorski_marriage_override_votes +] override votes**. Even Trzaskowski's veto
cannot save the marriage settlement.?]

[? if sikorski_left_veto_count > 0: The Palace has now issued **[+
sikorski_left_veto_count +] repeal vetoes**. Abortion rights, marriage equality
and labour enforcement survive wherever they had been enacted, but Sikorski's
campaign presents every preserved law as proof that [+ president_name +] will
veto Poland indefinitely. The charge costs the Left support each time it is
repeated.?]

The government places Military Gendarmerie guards at defence sites and cabinet
routes, Territorial Defence logistics behind police lines, and armoured police
units around Parliament. A demonstrator is critically injured by a police
projectile during an attempt to clear the ministry district. The cabinet calls
the deployment continuity of government. Protesters call it the point at which
a temporary bargain learned to govern through permanent emergency.

- @sikorski_security_nonviolence_2027
- @sikorski_security_general_strike_2027
- @sikorski_security_election_2027

@sikorski_security_nonviolence_2027
title: Impose a disciplined non-violence code
subtitle: Keep the coalition of protests broad enough to survive provocation and mass detention.
on-arrival: sikorski_protest_strength += 6; public_trust += 4; constitutional_restraint += 3; police_trust -= 2; party_unity += 1; news_headline = "The protest coalition adopts one disciplined non-violence code"

The code is agreed across every organisation on the street: stewards, published
routes, no masks, no provocation returned, and everybody trained on what to do
when the line moves. It is imposed on people who are extremely angry and it
holds.

Discipline of that kind is expensive and invisible. The government loses the
riot it needed for the evening broadcast; our own younger organisers ask how
long a movement is expected to absorb baton charges without answering them.

- @poland_event_queue: Agree the code

@sikorski_security_general_strike_2027
title: Turn the summer marches into a general strike
subtitle: Requires durable OPZZ cooperation, wider-union trust and mobilisation built in workplaces.
choose-if: general_strike_called = 0 and labor_relationship_state = "cooperative" and labor_mobilization >= 55 and union_trust >= 60 and opzz_cooperation >= 55 and labor_dissent <= 40
unavailable-subtitle: A party cannot announce a general strike on behalf of unions that do not trust it or lack workplace capacity.
on-arrival: general_strike_called = 1; sikorski_protest_strength += 18; workers_support += 7; labor_credibility += 5; union_trust += 4; opzz_cooperation += 5; labor_mobilization -= 15; labor_dissent += 4; public_trust -= 4; sikorski_police_militarisation += 2; party_unity += 3; razem_cooperation += 3; progressives_dissent -= 2; spring_dissent -= 1; barons_dissent += 3; news_headline = "A union-authorised general strike closes factories, schools and the ministry district"

Notice goes out through OPZZ and the workplace committees: a general strike,
dated, before the election rather than after it. Transport, schools and the
public hospitals decide first, and once they have decided the private sites
follow faster than the confederations expected.

This is the hardest instrument the union movement possesses and it can only be used once.
The cabinet answers with the security apparatus it has spent a year building,
and the country discovers in the same week both how much of it will stop work
and how far this government will go.

- @poland_event_queue: Send out the notice

@sikorski_security_election_2027
title: Move the evidence and organisers into the election campaign
subtitle: Refuse a final street showdown and make the repeal calendar the ballot's central record.
on-arrival: snap_campaign_left_bonus += 1.2; turnout_readiness += 6; media_capacity += 4; sikorski_protest_strength -= 4; party_unity += 2; news_headline = "The repeal movement turns its archive into an election operation"

We take the archive, the organisers and the mailing lists off the street and
into the campaign. The repeal calendar becomes the ballot: each frozen
appointment, each vetoed statute, each hospital that stopped issuing guidance,
attached to a date and a name.

It is the responsible decision and it feels like a retreat to everyone who has
been outside a ministry since winter. We are wagering that a documented record
beats another confrontation. The people who wanted the confrontation will judge
the wager in October.

- @poland_event_queue: Move it into the campaign
